{
  "abstract": "Kisielewicz's weak double extension set theory DEST has two membership relations and interprets ZF; its consistency was an open problem. This Lean 4 formalization (core only) proves that DEST is inconsistent, already without its regularity axiom. Comprehension alone, in intuitionistic logic, refutes every formula that is asymmetric between the two relations (DEST.diagonal); with mixed extensionality and classical logic, given as an explicit hypothesis, the ordinals are asymmetric, so DEST without regularity has no model (DEST.inconsistent), and neither has full DEST (DEST.DEST_inconsistent).",
